{"resourceIdentifier":"4243","resourceName":"Afforestation project with native and exotic species on degraded grasslands in Northeast, Argentina.","description":"The project activity is an afforestation project on multiple farms of extensive grazing lands. The overreaching goal is to promote innovative afforestation management activities on degraded lands. By combining native and exotic species to produce high-quality wood and other non-woody products and, in the long term, to generate new patches of managed native species forests. The grouped Project is located in Corrientes Province, in the Northeast region of Argentina (host country) and could include areas in the contiguous south of Misiones Province.  In this region, grazing and agriculture lands have different levels of degradation due to a long history of use without sustainable management. The activities proposed in the Project could stop the degradation processes and enhance the regional environmental conditions. For the design of the plantations, specific local conditions are considered to determine where species will be planted to promote facilitation strategies between them. Exotic species have favorable competition conditions over native ones (e.g., in standing flooded areas), but in return, they help native species with their development, protecting them from frosts, wind, and high radiation. Through forest plantation of native and exotic species, the Project sequesters CO2 by generating net anthropogenic removals by sinks that can be measured, monitored, and verified with known tools and approaches, contributing to the country's sustainable development.The initial activity instance comprises 2,331 hectares of degraded grassland generating an estimated average (long-term average) of ≈775.509 tCO2e net GHG emissions reductions and removals, implying a total GHG benefit for the environment of approximately ≈19.387. tCO2e per year for the length of the project (40 years).","location":{"latitude":-28.119212,"longitude":-56.167403},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-05-16","endExclusive":"2025-06-16","endInclusive":"2025-06-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4243"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Vista Energy Argentina SAU"},{"type":"string","value":"Buenos Aires, Argentina"},{"type":"string","value":"+5491161037034"},{"type":"string","value":"florencia.groba@vistaenergy.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18012"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2602000 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"20/12/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 07/07/2022 - 06/07/2062"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Vista Energy Argentina SAU"},{"type":"string","value":"Buenos Aires, Argentina"},{"type":"string","value":"+5491161037034"},{"type":"string","value":"florencia.groba@vistaenergy.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Under validation"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18012"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"s